#: usr/share/fish-tweak-tool/ftt_gui.py:114
msgid ""
"<b>Starship</b> — a fast, highly-customisable cross-shell prompt (a single "
"Rust binary, not a fisher plugin). Applying installs the <tt>starship</tt> "
"package if needed and enables it via <tt>starship init fish</tt>.\n"
"\n"
"<b>First steps:</b> configure it in <tt>~/.config/starship.toml</tt>; browse "
"presets and modules:"
msgstr ""
"<b>Starship</b>: un prompt veloce e altamente personalizzabile, compatibile "
"con più shell (un singolo binario Rust, non un plugin fisher). Quando lo "
"applichi, installa il pacchetto <tt>starship</tt> se necessario e lo abilita "
"tramite <tt>starship init fish</tt>.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Primi passi:</b> configuralo in <tt>~/.config/starship.toml</tt>; sfoglia "
"preset e moduli:"

